    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>Do I need any experience to attend a class?</h3>
      <p>No. All classes are open to all levels. Teaching is adapted to the people in the room.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>What should I wear?</h3>
      <p>Comfortable, loose-fitting clothing that allows you to move freely.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>Do I need to book in advance?</h3>
      <p>Yes, booking is required. Please book at least a few hours before the session via WhatsApp, Instagram or the booking form on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>Where are classes held?</h3>
      <p>Classes are currently held at studios and venues in Da Nang, at Danang Marriott Resort & Spa, and outdoors. Check the <a href="/classes/">schedule page</a> for specific venues.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>What makes this Qigong different?</h3>
      <p>Inner Flowing Qigong is high-precision practice rooted in Traditional Chinese Medicine, working directly with the body's meridian system, acupuncture points and Qi. For a full introduction, read <a href="/intro/">Introduction to Authentic Qigong</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>Are private sessions available?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Private one-on-one sessions are available in person and online. Please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> to arrange a time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal">
      <h3>Are online sessions available?</h3>
      <p>Yes. See the <a href="/online-courses/">Online Courses</a> page for all programmes.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:3em;" class="reveal">
      <a href="/contact/" class="cta-button">Still have questions? Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
